              Minimum charges of charged tools should be one higher.
wan1-343.txt  Digging is RAY, not BEAM, in the range discussion.
              No instakill from broken wand of death, and non-living
              monsters and demons resist.
              Cancelled monsters will not stick to you.
              Cancelled monsters will use wands of make invisible.
              92% chance of blank scroll polying to non-blank.
              Added listing of magical objects.
weap-343.txt  Dexterity bonuses apply to all attacks, not just melee.
              Increase accuracy bonus wasn't listed.

